7. **admin.js** (4 routes) - Admin operations
8. **subscription.js** (3 routes) - Subscription management
9. **drafts.js** (3 routes) - Draft management
10. **analytics.js** (2 routes) - Analytics
11. **referrals.js** (2 routes) - Referral system
12. **cache.js** (2 routes) - Cache management
13. **health.js** (1 route) - Health checks
14. **preferences.js** (1 route) - User preferences

**Benefits Achieved**:
- **Improved Maintainability**: Each file is focused and manageable
- **Better Organization**: Logical grouping by functionality
- **Enhanced Readability**: Easier to find and understand specific routes
- **Scalability**: Easy to add new routes to appropriate categories
- **Zero Downtime**: All existing API endpoints preserved
- **Shared Utilities**: Common functions extracted to reusable helpers
- **Consistent Structure**: All files follow same patterns and conventions

